# Personal data. The employee roster is real names and real email addresses,
# so it is never committed - this repository is public.
#
#   data/source/EE List - Cybersecurity.xlsx   the file HR sends you
#   data/source/employees.csv                  generated from it
#
# Keep them on the machine that runs the site. To set up a fresh checkout,
# drop the spreadsheet into data/source/ and run:
#   python data/scripts/import_roster.py
#   python data/scripts/build_db.py --reset
# Without them, build_db.py seeds a small demo roster so the site still runs.
data/source/
